# Nar Shaddaa, Vogga's dance (TSL, 302NAR, 301NAR, 003EBO, 306NAR,
# 303NAR), a branch from the Refugee Sector that rejoins nothing: a male
# Exile brings the Handmaiden ashore (with Kreia), Vogga's Twi'lek domo on
# the Promenade takes her as his dancer, the dance puts Vogga to sleep, and
# woken, he agrees to ship fuel to Telos once Goto is dealt with (the
# Exchange +1). Before the dance, the flophouse's thieves overheard in
# stealth (the Stealth Field Generator from Peragus worn; k_chkvoggathv
# plays their talk only for a party member IsStealthed, the party left
# standing back): juma juice for the kath hounds, haggled from the
# Promenade's bartender ([Persuade], 50 credits), poured in their urn while
# the dance has Vogga asleep, the hounds asleep and his hoard opened (the
# security door and the lens fixture's box picked, Security).
# Starts from the Refugee Sector's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @nar_shaddaa_refugees data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_vogga.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Vogga the Hutt" and GameBanshee's Entertainment
# Promenade (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit TO_301NAR       # back to the landing pad and aboard
module 301nar
to to_ebonhawk
wait 3s
if in 004ebo         # the Red Eclipse aboard, when the Exchange's notice
say Give up the slave trade - or else. # has brought them (the Exile's
say Then prepare to die. # levels make it so by now): fought, the Hawk
to REAttack          # retaken, as nar_shaddaa_exchange does
talk
fight 40
end
module 003ebo
party 4,6            # the Handmaiden and Kreia
to tr_leave
module 301nar
exit TO_303NAR       # the flophouse, its west block: the thieves' room
module 303nar
to NarShaddaaDoor01@7
solo on              # the party left standing back, out of their trigger
stealth on
to SneakVoggaThieves # overheard: the kath hounds sleep on juma juice
talk
stealth off
solo off
exit TO_301NAR
module 301nar
exit TO_306          # the Entertainment Promenade
module 306nar
say Actually, I'm looking for enough juma juice # the bartender: a
say [Persuade] A hundred credits is a lot for a flask # hundred haggled
say That's more like it. Here's the credits. # down to fifty
use Bartender
talk
say What's going on here? # Vogga's domo: his dancer gone, the Handmaiden
say What sort of arrangement? # offered and willing
say What about the Handmaiden?
say You're willing to do this?
say In that case, thank you.
to tr_domoconv
talk
module 303nar        # to Vogga's room: the dance, Vogga asleep
talk
until 303NAR_Vogga_Asleep=1
say Pour in juma juice. # the hounds' urn while Vogga sleeps: they drink
use WaternUrn        # and sleep
talk
until 303NAR_Kath_Asleep=1
unlock NarShaddaaDoor01@16 # the hoard's security door (DC 28)
use g_tresmilhig006  # the hoard's boxes (by template: the area has others
use g_tresmillow006@5 # so tagged), the lens fixture's last (DC 18, behind
unlock MilMidMetalBox # the low one)
use MilMidMetalBox
say Please wake him for me. # Vogga woken: the Exchange, Goto, and fuel
say I wanted to know about the Exchange. # for Telos once Goto is dealt
say What has Goto done to you? # with
say If I can take care of Goto, will you agree to ship fuel
say I just want to make sure Telos has fuel.
use Vogga
talk
until 200TEL_Fuel=3
